# Top-level requirement of the vLLM image. The full, hash-pinned closure lives
# in requirements.txt (generated by scripts/compile-requirements.sh).
#
# Official prebuilt CPU wheel from the vLLM 0.32.0 GitHub release (x86_64,
# AVX512/AVX2 dispatch at runtime, torch 2.13.0+cpu).
vllm @ https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/releases/download/v0.32.0/vllm-0.32.0+cpu-cp38-abi3-manylinux_2_39_x86_64.whl
